1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:05,960
Okay. Puppies.
Where do you stand on puppies?

2
00:00:06,457 --> 00:00:09,297
(Bernadette:)A puppy once bit my face.

3
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,920
(Howard:)Of course it did.

4
00:00:11,588 --> 00:00:14,168
(Leonard:)-How about that? Einstein was wrong.
-What?

5
00:00:14,382 --> 00:00:18,682
(Leonard:)Approaching the speed of light doesn't
slow down time, approaching them does.

6
00:00:19,971 --> 00:00:21,301
[MUSICAL RINGTONE PLAYING]

7
00:00:21,514 --> 00:00:22,974
(Howard(phone rings):)Excuse me.

8
00:00:23,141 --> 00:00:24,891
(Howard(phone rings):)Oh, damn. It's my mother.

9
00:00:25,059 --> 00:00:27,189
(Bernadette:)-Are you going to answer it?
-I'm torn.

10
00:00:27,353 --> 00:00:30,693
(Howard:)She might be dying and, you know,
wouldn't want to miss that.

11
00:00:32,442 --> 00:00:37,362
On other hand, if let it go to voicemail,
I could play it over and over.

12
00:00:39,032 --> 00:00:42,572
(Bernadette:)I know how you feel.
My mother makes me crazy.

13
00:00:42,744 --> 00:00:45,334
Yeah, not as crazy
as my mother makes me.

14
00:00:45,496 --> 00:00:47,916
(Bernadette:)Yeah? Does your mother call you
every day at work...

15
00:00:48,082 --> 00:00:50,332
(Bernadette:)...to see if you've had a healthy lunch?

16
00:00:50,501 --> 00:00:54,341
(Howard:)My mother calls me at work to see
if I had a healthy bowel movement.

17
00:00:58,718 --> 00:01:01,598
Okay, does she lay out your clothes
for you in the morning...

